  "body": "Fixes #7711.\n\n`markResultTransition` capped `appliedByRun` (200) and `resultNote` (2,000) with raw `slice`, so an astral character straddling either cap was stored as a lone high surrogate and persisted — the #7694 defect class on the action-result path, which the #7698 fix (cleanText only) did not reach.\n\n- Extract the surrogate-safe cap from `cleanText` into a shared `capUnits` helper; `cleanText` uses it unchanged.\n- `markResultTransition` now caps both result fields through `capUnits` — straddling pair dropped whole, cap semantics otherwise identical (no trim/empty changes).\n- Regression test in `actions.test.ts`: straddle at both the 200 and 2,000 caps stored whole-or-dropped, exact-fit pair kept whole.\n\nVerification (laptop, branch `bcfcd14365`):\n- Probe (real `actions.ts`, `~/git/fleet/probe-actions-result-surrogate`): pre-fix both caps stored a lone `0xd83d` and the persisted file contained `\\ud83d`; post-fix lengths 199 / 1,999, UTF-8 round-trip clean, no `\\ud83d` in the persisted file, exact-fit control intact.\n- `bun test test/actions.test.ts`: 28/28 pass on the branch; the new #7711 test fails on pre-fix code (27 pass / 1 fail with the src change stashed).\n- `bunx tsc --noEmit`: output identical to clean main (one pre-existing unrelated error in `test/roadmap-annotations.test.ts`).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796737834&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7713&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7713&signature=dfe03b9f965b5b7a271c3636c614e0eda44eb73f7b0aabfce14d69524ed74cee\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7713?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
